<figure class="figure">
<p><img src="https://jinu219.github.io/posts/wrf/2026-09-29-microphysics-fsbm/images/L3-L35-timeseries.png" class="img-fluid figure-img" alt="Time series for Lin, Morrison, fast SBM continental, and fast SBM maritime at dt 2 s: fast SBM continental keeps high cloud water and produces the least domain-mean rain, maritime is intermediate"></p>
<figcaption>Lin, Morrison, fast SBM 대륙성·해양성의 최대 W, 최대 구름물, 최대 빗물, 영역 평균 누적강수 (dt 2 s).</figcaption>
</figure>
